# venvs

> HTML shelf named venvs. Sister of venv and venv-audio.

## Purpose
Give a plain-language door to fitzyracing1/venvs.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Keep the original repo as the place for files.
2. Use this clone to explain the idea.
3. Send the reader back to the source.

## Key ideas
- venvs (the named shelf)
- HTML source

## The actual code
```
# source: fitzyracing1/venvs
open_source()
```

## Line-by-line translation
1. open_source() → “go to fitzyracing1/venvs”

## Decisions the program makes
- If a reader wants venv or venv-audio → those wraps

## What a person would notice
A named wrap on a venvs door.

## Current status
Barrage clone.

## Next possible steps
Open the source.
